Parse Jira data into a list of <code>jira-to-org-item</code> structs for further processing.
</p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="outline-container-orgc488f8c" class="outline-3">
<h3 id="orgc488f8c"><code>jira-to-org--item-to-org-heading</code></h3>
<div class="outline-text-3" id="text-orgc488f8c">
<div class="org-src-container">
<pre><code class="language-lisp">(jira-to-org--item-to-org-heading ITEM &amp;optional SPRINT)
